    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A native iOS and Android shopping app for <strong>OpenCart 4.1.0.4</strong> stores, built with Expo, React Native and TypeScript. All of its data comes from your store through the <strong>Mobile App API</strong> extension included in <a href="https://github.com/rupaknepali/opencart-mobile">the GitHub repository</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:list -->
<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Shopping:</strong> catalog, search, products with every option type, cart, wishlist and checkout, with the same prices, taxes, stock rules and coupons as your website.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->
<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Payments:</strong> every installed OpenCart payment and shipping extension works. Cash on Delivery, Bank Transfer, Cheque and Free Checkout complete inside the app; online gateways run in a secure in-app web view.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->
<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Accounts:</strong> customer accounts, address book and order history, shared with the website.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->
<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Branding:</strong> the app&#39;s colours are set from the OpenCart admin.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:buttons -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://github.com/rupaknepali/opencart-mobile">View on GitHub</a></div>
